    {
      "bbox": [
        195,
        681,
        1500,
        760
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, over the past several months, thousands of asylum seekers have been arriving in New York City, from the Southern border, without having any immediate plans for shelter;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2946,
          "min": -1.289
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0315,
          "min": -0.6475
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17183,
        "area_px": 101831,
        "density": 0.16874,
        "chars": 181,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.53
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        796,
        1500,
        947
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, the City now faces an unprecedented humanitarian crisis that requires it to take extraordinary measures to meet the immediate needs of the asylum seekers while continuing to serve the tens of thousands of people who are currently using the Department of Homeless Services' Shelter System;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2902,
          "min": -1.4603
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0344
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28237,
        "area_px": 194639,
        "density": 0.14507,
        "chars": 301,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.66
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        195,
        987,
        1500,
        1064
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, additional reasons for requiring the measures continued in this Order are set forth in Emergency Executive Order No. 224, dated October 7, 2022;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2264,
          "min": -1.4211
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0054
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14617,
        "area_px": 100542,
        "density": 0.14538,
        "chars": 157,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        1103,
        1500,
        1219
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, the state of emergency based on the arrival of thousands of individuals and families seeking asylum, first declared in Emergency Executive Order No. 224, dated October 7, 2022, and extended by subsequent orders, remains in effect;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2066,
          "min": -1.2965
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0015
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 22745,
        "area_px": 149524,
        "density": 0.15212,
        "chars": 243,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.68
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        1258,
        1500,
        1375
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, other states, municipalities, and non-governmental organizations have sent charter buses to the City containing passengers who such entities know or should know to be individuals who have arrived in the United States from other nations since March 2022;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2027,
          "min": -1.2435
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0008
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 24459,
        "area_px": 150813,
        "density": 0.16218,
        "chars": 266,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.88
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        1412,
        1500,
        1489
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, a great many passengers on such charter buses have sought emergency shelter and other immediate services from the City;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2035,
          "min": -1.1645
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0264
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12732,
        "area_px": 99253,
        "density": 0.12828,
        "chars": 132,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        190,
        1528,
        1500,
        1643
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, the entities sending such charter buses know or should know that the passengers on such buses are likely to seek emergency shelter and other immediate services from the City upon or soon after arrival in the City;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2196,
          "min": -1.3614
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
