        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.28
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        188,
        1838,
        1500,
        1955
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**WHEREAS**, such charter buses often drop off passengers at random locations in the City in a manner that is interfering with and hampering the City's ability to manage this humanitarian crisis, including efforts to meet buses and provide emergency services as needed;",
